<title>JAPAN: Star Micronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Star Micronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.34		vs	   18.89</p>
<p> Operating	prft 820 million	  vs   loss 123    million</p>
<p> Current	    979    million	  vs	  751    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 3.02		vs	prft 343 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 53.48 yen	  vs     prft 6.09 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     56 million	  vs	  56 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Star Micronics Co Ltd is an electronic printer maker affiliated with Citizen Watch Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
